msgstr "%(message)s – %(count)d×, zuletzt %(when)s"

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:108
msgid "Enter the new host name, e.g. rentalars.example.com."
msgstr "Gib den neuen Hostnamen ein, z. B. rentalars.example.com."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:110
msgid ""
"Only the name, without a port, path or spaces – e.g. rentalars.example.com."
msgstr ""
"Nur den Namen, ohne Port, Pfad und Leerzeichen – z. B. "
"rentalars.example.com."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:116
msgid "Enter a name, not an IP address."
msgstr "Gib einen Namen ein, keine IP-Adresse."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:120 rentalars/core/server_address.py:123
msgid "This is not a valid host name."
msgstr "Das ist kein gültiger Hostname."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:125
msgid ""
"“localhost” cannot be reached by others. Enter the name people will use."
msgstr ""
"„localhost“ ist für andere nicht erreichbar. Gib den Namen ein, den alle "
"verwenden werden."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:131
msgid ""
"Let's Encrypt only issues certificates for names in the public DNS. For a "
"name within your network, use your own certificate."
msgstr ""
"Let's Encrypt stellt Zertifikate nur für Namen im öffentlichen DNS aus. Für "
"einen Namen in deinem Netz nimm ein eigenes Zertifikat."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:290
msgid "Upload the certificate file (PEM, at most 100 kB)."
msgstr "Lade die Zertifikatsdatei hoch (PEM, höchstens 100 kB)."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:292
msgid "Upload the private key (PEM, at most 100 kB)."
msgstr "Lade den privaten Schlüssel hoch (PEM, höchstens 100 kB)."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:302
msgid ""
"The certificate file contains no certificate in PEM format (text beginning "
"with “-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----”)."
msgstr ""
"Die Zertifikatsdatei enthält kein Zertifikat im PEM-Format (Text, der mit "
"„-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----“ beginnt)."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:308
msgid ""
"The certificate file contains a private key. Upload the key as a separate "
"file and the certificate without it."
msgstr ""
"Die Zertifikatsdatei enthält einen privaten Schlüssel. Lade den Schlüssel "
"als eigene Datei hoch und das Zertifikat ohne ihn."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:317
msgid ""
"The private key is protected by a password. NGINX needs it without a "
"password: openssl pkey -in key.pem -out key-open.pem"
msgstr ""
"Der private Schlüssel ist mit einem Passwort geschützt. NGINX braucht ihn "
"ohne Passwort: openssl pkey -in key.pem -out key-open.pem"

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:323
msgid ""
"The key file contains a certificate, not a private key. Were the two files "
"swapped?"
msgstr ""
"Die Schlüsseldatei enthält ein Zertifikat, keinen privaten Schlüssel. Sind "
"die beiden Dateien vertauscht?"

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:326
msgid "The key file contains no private key in PEM format."
msgstr "Die Schlüsseldatei enthält keinen privaten Schlüssel im PEM-Format."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:331
#, python-format
msgid "The key is too short (%(bits)d bits); browsers require at least 2048."
msgstr ""
"Der Schlüssel ist zu kurz (%(bits)d Bit); Browser verlangen mindestens 2048."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:346
msgid "The key does not belong to any certificate in the file."
msgstr "Der Schlüssel gehört zu keinem Zertifikat der Datei."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:360
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The file contains certificates that do not belong to the chain of the "
"server's certificate (%(names)s). The chain must lead from the server's "
"certificate to the one that issued it, and so on."
msgstr ""
"Die Datei enthält Zertifikate, die nicht zur Kette des Serverzertifikats "
"gehören (%(names)s). Die Kette muss vom Zertifikat des Servers zu dem "
"führen, das es ausgestellt hat, und so weiter."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:366
msgid ""
"The certificates were put into the right order: the server's certificate "
"first."
msgstr ""
"Die Zertifikate wurden in die richtige Reihenfolge gebracht: das des Servers"
" zuerst."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:373
msgid ""
"The certificate names no host names (Subject Alternative Name); browsers "
"require them."
msgstr ""
"Das Zertifikat nennt keine Hostnamen (Subject Alternative Name); Browser "
"verlangen sie."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:377
#, python-format
msgid "The certificate is valid for %(names)s, not for %(host)s."
msgstr "Das Zertifikat gilt für %(names)s, nicht für %(host)s."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:382
#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s is only valid from %(date)s."
msgstr "%(name)s gilt erst ab %(date)s."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:387
#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s expired on %(date)s."
msgstr "%(name)s ist am %(date)s abgelaufen."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:393
#, python-format
msgid "The certificate expires in %(days)d day, on %(date)s."
msgid_plural "The certificate expires in %(days)d days, on %(date)s."
msgstr[0] "Das Zertifikat läuft in %(days)d Tag ab, am %(date)s."
msgstr[1] "Das Zertifikat läuft in %(days)d Tagen ab, am %(date)s."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:402
msgid ""
"The certificate is self-signed: browsers will warn until it is trusted on "
"every device."
msgstr ""
"Das Zertifikat ist selbst signiert: Browser warnen, bis es auf jedem Gerät "
"als vertrauenswürdig eingetragen ist."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:409
msgid ""
"The intermediate certificates are missing, or no authority known to browsers"
" issued it. Add the intermediate certificates of your provider to the "
"certificate file, after the server's certificate."
msgstr ""
"Die Zwischenzertifikate fehlen, oder keine Browsern bekannte "
"Zertifizierungsstelle hat es ausgestellt. Füge die Zwischenzertifikate "
"deines Providers in die Zertifikatsdatei ein, nach dem Zertifikat des "
"Servers."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:417
msgid ""
"No certificate authority known to browsers issued the certificate. That is "
"fine for an authority of your company that is trusted on every device; "
"otherwise browsers will warn."
msgstr ""
"Keine Browsern bekannte Zertifizierungsstelle hat das Zertifikat "
"ausgestellt. Für eine Stelle deiner Firma, der jedes Gerät vertraut, ist das"
" in Ordnung; sonst warnen Browser."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:511
msgid "Let's Encrypt, renewed automatically"
msgstr "Let's Encrypt, erneuert sich selbst"

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:514
msgid "No certificate of its own: a server in front encrypts (TLS proxy)"
msgstr "Kein eigenes Zertifikat: Ein Server davor verschlüsselt (TLS-Proxy)"

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:515
msgid "Certificate file of the server (could not be read)"
msgstr "Zertifikatsdatei des Servers (nicht lesbar)"

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:530
#, python-format
msgid ""
"There is no NGINX site of the installation on this server (%(path)s): "
"Rentalars is probably behind another server that encrypts, or this is a "
"development installation."
msgstr ""
"Auf diesem Server gibt es keine NGINX-Konfiguration der Installation "
"(%(path)s): Rentalars steht vermutlich hinter einem anderen Server, der "
"verschlüsselt, oder dies ist eine Entwicklungsinstallation."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:539
msgid "NGINX did not answer on port 443; the certificate could not be read."
msgstr ""
"NGINX hat auf Port 443 nicht geantwortet; das Zertifikat ließ sich nicht "
"lesen."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:587
#, python-format
msgid "DNS of %(host)s"
msgstr "DNS von %(host)s"

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:594
msgid ""
"The name cannot be resolved (yet). Before the command is run, it must point "
"to this server."
msgstr ""
"Der Name lässt sich (noch) nicht auflösen. Bevor der Befehl läuft, muss er "
"auf diesen Server zeigen."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:603
#, python-format
msgid "Points to this server (%(addresses)s)."
msgstr "Zeigt auf diesen Server (%(addresses)s)."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:609
#, python-format
msgid "Points to the same address as the current name (%(addresses)s)."
msgstr "Zeigt auf dieselbe Adresse wie der bisherige Name (%(addresses)s)."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:618
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Points to %(addresses)s. This server does not know that address as its own –"
" behind a router (NAT) that is normal. Rentalars cannot tell for sure "
"whether it leads here; please check."
msgstr ""
"Zeigt auf %(addresses)s. Diese Adresse kennt der Server nicht als eigene – "
"hinter einem Router (NAT) ist das normal. Ob sie hierher führt, kann "
"Rentalars nicht sicher sagen; bitte prüf es."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:631
msgid ""
"The name points to an address within a private network; Let's Encrypt cannot"
" reach it from the internet. Use your own certificate."
msgstr ""
"Der Name zeigt auf eine Adresse in einem privaten Netz; Let's Encrypt "
"erreicht sie aus dem Internet nicht. Nimm ein eigenes Zertifikat."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:638 rentalars/core/server_address.py:646
#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:652
msgid "Ports"
msgstr "Ports"

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:638
msgid ""
"Not checked: there is no NGINX site of the installation on this server."
msgstr ""
"Nicht geprüft: Auf diesem Server gibt es keine NGINX-Konfiguration der "
"Installation."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:647
#, python-format
msgid "Nothing answers on port %(ports)s of this server. Is NGINX running?"
msgstr "Auf Port %(ports)s dieses Servers antwortet nichts. Läuft NGINX?"

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:652
msgid "NGINX answers on ports 80 and 443 of this server."
msgstr "NGINX antwortet auf den Ports 80 und 443 dieses Servers."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:657
msgid "Port 80 from the internet"
msgstr "Port 80 aus dem Internet"

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:659
msgid ""
"Let's Encrypt checks the name through port 80 from the internet. Whether the"
" router lets it through cannot be checked from here."
msgstr ""
"Let's Encrypt prüft den Namen über Port 80 aus dem Internet. Ob der Router "
"das durchlässt, lässt sich von hier aus nicht prüfen."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:722
msgid "Choose where the certificate comes from."
msgstr "Wähle, woher das Zertifikat kommt."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:733
msgid "Let's Encrypt needs an e-mail address for notices about the expiry."
msgstr "Let's Encrypt braucht eine E-Mail-Adresse für Hinweise zum Ablauf."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:737
msgid "This is the current address already; there is nothing to change."
msgstr "Das ist schon die aktuelle Adresse; es gibt nichts zu ändern."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:747
#, python-format
msgid "Valid for %(names)s until %(date)s, issued by %(issuer)s."
msgstr "Gilt für %(names)s bis %(date)s, ausgestellt von %(issuer)s."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:797
msgid ""
"Checks the prepared change again itself: the name and – for your own "
"certificate – key, chain, names and validity."
msgstr ""
"Prüft die vorbereitete Änderung selbst noch einmal: den Namen und – beim "
"eigenen Zertifikat – Schlüssel, Kette, Namen und Gültigkeit."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:799
msgid ""
"Backs up the configuration file, the NGINX site and the certificates to "
"/etc/rentalars/address-backup/."
msgstr ""
"Sichert Konfigurationsdatei, NGINX-Konfiguration und Zertifikate nach "
"/etc/rentalars/address-backup/."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:804
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Requests a certificate for %(host)s from Let's Encrypt (installs certbot if "
"it is missing); it renews itself. Port 80 must be reachable from the "
"internet."
msgstr ""
"Holt ein Zertifikat für %(host)s von Let's Encrypt (installiert certbot, "
"falls es fehlt); es erneuert sich selbst. Port 80 muss aus dem Internet "
"erreichbar sein."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:810
#, python-format
msgid "Creates a self-signed certificate for %(host)s, valid for 825 days."
msgstr ""
"Erstellt ein selbst signiertes Zertifikat für %(host)s, gültig 825 Tage."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:813
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Installs your certificate and key in /etc/rentalars/tls/%(host)s/ – the key "
"readable by root only."
msgstr ""
"Legt dein Zertifikat und den Schlüssel in /etc/rentalars/tls/%(host)s/ ab – "
"den Schlüssel nur für root lesbar."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:817
msgid ""
"Leaves the certificates as they are: the server in front must know the new "
"name."
msgstr ""
"Lässt die Zertifikate, wie sie sind: Der Server davor muss den neuen Namen "
"kennen."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:819
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Sets the address in the configuration file to https://%(host)s and the name "
"in the NGINX site."
msgstr ""
"Setzt die Adresse in der Konfigurationsdatei auf https://%(host)s und den "
"Namen in der NGINX-Konfiguration."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:825
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Redirects the old address %(old)s to the new one – over HTTPS as long as the"
" old certificate is valid for it."
msgstr ""
"Leitet die alte Adresse %(old)s auf die neue weiter – über HTTPS, solange "
"das alte Zertifikat für sie gilt."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:831
msgid ""
"Checks the NGINX configuration, reloads NGINX and restarts Rentalars – a few"
" seconds without access."
msgstr ""
"Prüft die NGINX-Konfiguration, lädt NGINX neu und startet Rentalars neu – "
"einige Sekunden ohne Zugriff."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:832
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Checks that https://%(host)s answers. If any step fails, it puts everything "
"back as it was."
msgstr ""
"Prüft, dass https://%(host)s antwortet. Schlägt ein Schritt fehl, stellt er "
"alles wieder her wie vorher."

#: rentalars/core/server_address.py:834
msgid "Records the result here."
msgstr "Vermerkt das Ergebnis hier."

#: rentalars/core/settings_views.py:60 templates/core/access_log.html:3
#: templates/core/access_log.html:9 templates/core/administration.html:112
msgid "Access log"
msgstr "Zugriffsprotokoll"

#: rentalars/core/settings_views.py:132
msgid ""
"The backup is being written. You can go on working; you will be told when it"
" is ready."
msgstr ""
"Die Sicherung wird geschrieben. Du kannst weiterarbeiten; du bekommst "
"Bescheid, wenn sie fertig ist."

#: rentalars/core/surcharge_api.py:98
msgid "There is no such entry."
msgstr "Diesen Eintrag gibt es nicht."

#: rentalars/core/surcharge_api.py:265
msgid "Give a year from 1900 to 2200."
msgstr "Gib ein Jahr von 1900 bis 2200 an."

#: rentalars/core/surcharge_api.py:273
#, python-format
msgid "Unknown federal state. Known: %(states)s"
msgstr "Unbekanntes Bundesland. Bekannt sind: %(states)s"

