msgstr "Absage: %(deployment)s %(tag)s"

#: rentalars/mail/crew_answers.py:280
#, python-format
msgid "Acceptance for: %(deployment)s"
msgstr "Zusage für: %(deployment)s"

#: rentalars/mail/crew_answers.py:280
#, python-format
msgid "Refusal for: %(deployment)s"
msgstr "Absage für: %(deployment)s"

#: rentalars/mail/crew_answers.py:287
msgid ""
"Please leave the subject as it is: Rentalars recognises your answer by the "
"code in square brackets."
msgstr ""
"Bitte den Betreff so lassen: Rentalars erkennt deine Antwort am Code in "
"eckigen Klammern."

#: rentalars/mail/crew_answers.py:348 rentalars/projects/crew.py:609
#, python-format
msgid "Deployment request with new times: %(deployment)s"
msgstr "Einsatzanfrage mit neuen Zeiten: %(deployment)s"

#: rentalars/mail/crew_answers.py:352 rentalars/projects/crew.py:612
#, python-format
msgid "Deployment request: %(deployment)s"
msgstr "Einsatzanfrage: %(deployment)s"

#: rentalars/mail/crew_answers.py:770
#, python-format
msgid "This request was answered already: %(answer)s."
msgstr "Diese Anfrage ist schon beantwortet: %(answer)s."

#: rentalars/mail/crew_answers.py:773
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The answer did not come from the address this request was sent to, but from "
"%(sender)s. Only a mail from your own address counts: please answer from "
"there, or in Rentalars. If you did not send it, somebody may have got your "
"request mail forwarded."
msgstr ""
"Die Antwort kam nicht von der Adresse, an die diese Anfrage ging, sondern "
"von %(sender)s. Es zählt nur eine Mail von deiner eigenen Adresse: Bitte "
"antworte von dort oder in Rentalars. Wenn du sie nicht geschickt hast, hat "
"vielleicht jemand deine Anfrage weitergeleitet bekommen."

#: rentalars/mail/crew_answers.py:780
msgid ""
"The check of the sender of the answer by the mail server failed; the sender "
"address looks forged. Please answer again, or in Rentalars."
msgstr ""
"Die Prüfung des Absenders der Antwort durch den Mailserver ist "
"fehlgeschlagen; die Absenderadresse sieht gefälscht aus. Bitte antworte noch"
" einmal oder in Rentalars."

#: rentalars/mail/crew_answers.py:784
msgid ""
"The mail server did not confirm who sent the answer (no DMARC or DKIM pass "
"for the sender). An answer by mail counts only when it is confirmed: please "
"answer in Rentalars."
msgstr ""
"Der Mailserver hat nicht bestätigt, wer die Antwort geschickt hat (kein "
"bestandener DMARC- oder DKIM-Test für den Absender). Eine Antwort per Mail "
"zählt nur, wenn sie bestätigt ist: Bitte antworte in Rentalars."

#: rentalars/mail/crew_answers.py:787
msgid "The deployment is over."
msgstr "Der Einsatz ist schon vorbei."

#: rentalars/mail/crew_answers.py:789
msgid ""
"There is a newer request for this deployment. Please answer with the buttons"
" of the newest mail."
msgstr ""
"Für diesen Einsatz gibt es eine neuere Anfrage. Bitte antworte mit den "
"Knöpfen der neuesten Mail."

#: rentalars/mail/crew_answers.py:791
msgid "The project was cancelled or closed."
msgstr "Das Projekt wurde abgesagt oder abgeschlossen."

#: rentalars/mail/crew_answers.py:792
msgid ""
"The request no longer holds: it was withdrawn, or somebody else is planned "
