msgid "surcharge in percent"
msgstr "Aufpreis in Prozent"

#: rentalars/products/models.py:248 rentalars/products/models.py:257
msgid "Empty: as the category or the default."
msgstr "Leer: wie Kategorie oder Voreinstellung."

#: rentalars/products/models.py:269
msgid ""
"No line of this product is discounted more – by its own discount, the "
"customer's standard discount or its group's. 0: never discounted. Empty: no "
"limit."
msgstr ""
"Keine Position dieses Produkts wird stärker rabattiert – weder durch ihren "
"eigenen Rabatt noch durch den Standardrabatt des Kunden oder den der "
"Teilgruppe. 0: nie rabattiert. Leer: keine Grenze."

#: rentalars/products/models.py:276 rentalars/projects/models.py:1860
msgid "limit in hours per day"
msgstr "Grenze in Stunden pro Tag"

#: rentalars/products/models.py:283
msgid ""
"Only for services billed by the hour: the hours of one day beyond this cost "
"the price from the limit, e.g. 10 – from the 11th hour of a day. Empty: "
"every hour costs the same."
msgstr ""
"Nur für Dienstleistungen nach Stunden: Die Stunden eines Tages über dieser "
"Grenze kosten den Preis ab der Grenze, z. B. 10 – ab der 11. Stunde eines "
"Tages. Leer: Jede Stunde kostet gleich viel."

#: rentalars/products/models.py:288
msgid "price per hour from the limit (net)"
msgstr "Preis je Stunde ab der Grenze (netto)"

#: rentalars/products/models.py:300
msgid ""
"Only for services billed by the hour. Off: crew lines of this service get no"
" surcharges, neither on the price nor on the costs."
msgstr ""
"Nur für Dienstleistungen nach Stunden. Aus: Personalpositionen dieser "
"Dienstleistung bekommen keine Zuschläge, weder im Preis noch in den Kosten."

#: rentalars/products/models.py:307
msgid "vehicle type"
msgstr "Fahrzeugart"

#: rentalars/products/models.py:307
msgid "Only for vehicles."
msgstr "Nur bei Fahrzeugen."

#: rentalars/products/models.py:310
msgid "price per kilometre (net)"
msgstr "Preis je Kilometer (netto)"

#: rentalars/products/models.py:316
msgid ""
"For a motor vehicle its rate; for a trailer the rate when it is billed per "
"kilometre."
msgstr ""
"Beim KFZ sein Satz; beim Anhänger der Satz, wenn er nach Kilometern "
"abgerechnet wird."

#: rentalars/products/models.py:319
msgid "trailer surcharge per kilometre (net)"
msgstr "Anhängerzuschlag je Kilometer (netto)"

#: rentalars/products/models.py:325
msgid ""
"Only for motor vehicles: added to the price per kilometre on trips with a "
"trailer."
msgstr ""
"Nur bei KFZ: kommt auf Fahrten mit Anhänger zum Preis je Kilometer hinzu."

#: rentalars/products/models.py:328
msgid "trailer billed"
msgstr "Anhänger abrechnen"

#: rentalars/products/models.py:332
msgid ""
"Only for trailers: how a new booking is billed; it can be switched in the "
"project."
msgstr ""
"Nur bei Anhängern: wie eine neue Buchung abgerechnet wird; im Projekt "
"umschaltbar."

#: rentalars/products/models.py:335 rentalars/projects/models.py:2619
msgid "internal cost per kilometre"
msgstr "interne Kosten je Kilometer"

#: rentalars/products/models.py:341
msgid "Fuel, wear, insurance – what a kilometre costs the company."
msgstr ""
"Kraftstoff, Verschleiß, Versicherung – was ein Kilometer die Firma kostet."

#: rentalars/products/models.py:344 rentalars/projects/models.py:2627
msgid "internal cost per day"
msgstr "interne Kosten je Tag"

#: rentalars/products/models.py:350
msgid "Only for trailers billed per day: what a day costs the company."
msgstr "Nur bei Anhängern mit Tagesmiete: was ein Tag die Firma kostet."

#: rentalars/products/models.py:355
