"merchandise, a low-value asset (GWG) or a fixed asset. Unless you choose a "
"kind, a piece up to the limit is a low-value asset and a more expensive one "
"a fixed asset; a fixed asset without a useful life gets the standard one. "
"From these values the depreciation and the book value of the items are "
"worked out (Buchhaltung → Anlagenspiegel)."
msgstr ""
