"Upload your own invoices of past projects as PDF. Each one is read and shown"
" for checking: customer, invoice data and positions. Only after you confirm,"
" a closed project with its invoice is created for it. No mail is sent, "
"nothing is reserved, and the numbers of your current invoices stay "
"untouched."
